#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1714
msgid ""
"**The access log.** Each HTTP request writes one line when its response "
"ends. The members are always these, in this order:"
msgstr ""
"**سجل الوصول.** يكتب كل طلب HTTP سطرًا واحدًا حين تنتهي استجابته. "
"والأعضاء هي هذه دائمًا، بهذا الترتيب:"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1721
msgid "Value"
msgstr "القيمة"

