msgstr "``tls_version``, ``tls_cipher``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1733
msgid ""
"The TLS version (``1.2``, ``1.3``) and the IANA name of the cipher suite, "
"or ``-`` without TLS. The suite of an ``h3`` connection is ``-``."
msgstr ""
"إصدار TLS (``1.2`` أو ``1.3``) واسم IANA لمجموعة التشفير، أو ``-`` من دون "
"TLS. ومجموعة التشفير لاتصال ``h3`` هي ``-``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1734
msgid "``method``, ``host``, ``path``"
msgstr "``method``, ``host``, ``path``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1735
msgid ""
"As sent. The path is in normal form and has no query. A request that did "
"not parse has ``-``."
msgstr ""
"كما أُرسلت. والمسار في صيغته المُطبَّعة وليس فيه استعلام. والطلب الذي لم "
"يُحلَّل له ``-``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1736
msgid "``status``"
msgstr "``status``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1737
msgid ""
"The status sent to the client. 499 when the client closed the connection "
"or reset the stream before any response. No client receives a 499."
msgstr ""
"الحالة المرسلة إلى العميل. و499 حين يغلق العميل الاتصال أو يعيد ضبط "
"التدفق قبل أي استجابة. ولا يتلقى أي عميل 499."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1738
msgid "``bytes_in``, ``bytes_out``"
msgstr "``bytes_in``, ``bytes_out``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1739
msgid ""
"The bytes of the request and of the response as HTTP/1.1 carries them, "
"without TLS. For ``http/1.1`` these are the bytes of the message. For "
"``h2`` and ``h3`` a head counts as its HTTP/1.1 text and a body as its "
"data bytes. One case is not exact: a chunked ``http/1.1`` request body "
"counts its data bytes without the chunk framing."
msgstr ""
"بايتات الطلب والاستجابة كما يحملها HTTP/1.1، دون TLS. وفي ``http/1.1`` "
"هذه بايتات الرسالة. وفي ``h2`` و\\ ``h3`` يُحتسب الرأس بنصه في HTTP/1.1 "
"والجسم ببايتات بياناته. وحالة واحدة غير دقيقة: جسم طلب ``http/1.1`` "
"المجزأ يُحتسب ببايتات بياناته دون تأطير الأجزاء."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1740
msgid "``duration_ms``"
msgstr "``duration_ms``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1741
msgid "From the dispatch to the end of the response."
msgstr "من الإرسال إلى نهاية الاستجابة."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1742
msgid "``ttfb_ms``"
msgstr "``ttfb_ms``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1743
msgid ""
"The wait for the first byte of the server, or ``null`` when no server "
"answered."
msgstr "انتظار أول بايت من الخادم، أو ``null`` حين لا يجيب أي خادم."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1744
msgid "``backend``, ``server``"
msgstr "``backend``, ``server``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1745
msgid "The pool and the server the request was sent to, or ``-``."
msgstr "المجمّع والخادم اللذان أُرسل إليهما الطلب، أو ``-``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1746
msgid "``verdict``"
msgstr "``verdict``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1747
msgid ""
"``pass``, ``deny``, ``challenge``, ``rate_limited``, ``banned``, "
"``internal`` or ``-``."
msgstr ""
"``pass`` أو ``deny`` أو ``challenge`` أو ``rate_limited`` أو ``banned`` "
"أو ``internal`` أو ``-``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1749
msgid ""
"The number of servers the request left before the one that ended it. 0 "
"unless the request moved."
msgstr ""
"عدد الخوادم التي تركها الطلب قبل الخادم الذي أنهاه. وهو 0 ما لم ينتقل "
"الطلب."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1751
msgid ""
"{\"time\":\"2026-11-24T10:15:02.418Z\",\"client\":\"203.0.113.7\",\"frontend\":\"web\",\"protocol\":\"http/1.1\",\"scheme\":\"https\",\"tls_version\":\"1.3\",\"tls_cipher\":\"TLS13_AES_128_GCM_SHA256\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"host\":\"www.example.com\",\"path\":\"/index.html\",\"status\":200,\"bytes_in\":112,\"bytes_out\":5310,\"duration_ms\":3.184,\"ttfb_ms\":2.907,\"backend\":\"app\",\"server\":\"app-2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"retries\":0}"
msgstr ""
"{\"time\":\"2026-11-24T10:15:02.418Z\",\"client\":\"203.0.113.7\",\"frontend\":\"web\",\"protocol\":\"http/1.1\",\"scheme\":\"https\",\"tls_version\":\"1.3\",\"tls_cipher\":\"TLS13_AES_128_GCM_SHA256\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"host\":\"www.example.com\",\"path\":\"/index.html\",\"status\":200,\"bytes_in\":112,\"bytes_out\":5310,\"duration_ms\":3.184,\"ttfb_ms\":2.907,\"backend\":\"app\",\"server\":\"app-2\",\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"retries\":0}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1755
msgid ""
"A worker never waits for the log. It puts the entry in a bounded queue, "
"and one thread formats and writes. When the queue is full the entry is "
"dropped and ``sibuna_edge_access_log_dropped_total`` counts it."
msgstr ""
"لا ينتظر العامل السجل أبدًا. فهو يضع المدخل في طابور محدود، ويتولى خيط "
"واحد التنسيق والكتابة. وحين يمتلئ الطابور يُسقط المدخل ويعدّه "
"``sibuna_edge_access_log_dropped_total``."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1757
msgid ""
"There is no log unless we configure one. A reload may change everything "
"in ``observability``: the ``output``, the ``queue``, ``internal_allow`` "
"and ``listen``, and it may remove the ``access_log`` object or add it. "
"The new file and the new listener are opened first. When one of them "
"cannot be opened, the reload is refused and the old ones serve on. A new "
"``listen`` address must differ from the old one in its port, or be "
"reached in two reloads."
msgstr ""
"لا سجل ما لم نضبط سجلًا. ويجوز لإعادة التحميل أن تغير كل شيء في "
"``observability``: ``output`` و\\ ``queue`` و\\ ``internal_allow`` و\\ "
"``listen``، ويجوز لها أن تزيل الكائن ``access_log`` أو تضيفه. ويُفتح "
"الملف الجديد والمستمع الجديد أولًا. وحين يتعذر فتح أحدهما، تُرفض إعادة "
"التحميل ويواصل القديمان الخدمة. ويجب أن يختلف عنوان ``listen`` الجديد عن "
"القديم في منفذه، أو أن يُبلغ في إعادتي تحميل."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1759
msgid ""
"**TCP and UDP flows.** A ``tcp`` connection and a ``udp`` mapping write "
"one line when they end. So does a refused connection, at most ten times "
"per second for the whole node. The counter ``sibuna_edge_refused_total`` "
"has every one."
msgstr ""
"**تدفقات TCP وUDP.** يكتب اتصال ``tcp`` وتعيين ``udp`` سطرًا واحدًا حين "
"ينتهيان. وكذلك الاتصال المرفوض، عشر مرات في الثانية على الأكثر للعقدة "
"كلها. ويحتوي العداد ``sibuna_edge_refused_total`` على كل واحد منها."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1761
msgid ""
"{\"time\":\"2026-11-24T10:15:09.102Z\",\"client\":\"203.0.113.7\",\"frontend\":\"db\",\"protocol\":\"tcp\",\"backend\":\"db\",\"server\":\"10.0.0.11:5432\",\"bytes_in\":412,\"bytes_out\":9120,\"duration_ms\":6841.337,\"end\":\"client_closed\"}"
msgstr ""
"{\"time\":\"2026-11-24T10:15:09.102Z\",\"client\":\"203.0.113.7\",\"frontend\":\"db\",\"protocol\":\"tcp\",\"backend\":\"db\",\"server\":\"10.0.0.11:5432\",\"bytes_in\":412,\"bytes_out\":9120,\"duration_ms\":6841.337,\"end\":\"client_closed\"}"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1769
msgid "``end``"
msgstr "``end``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1771
msgid "``client_closed``, ``server_closed``"
msgstr "``client_closed``, ``server_closed``"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/operations.rst:1772
