"UDP; the kernel holds the datagrams\"),\n"
"    act(\"old\", \"Pause UDP, keep accepting TCP\"),\n"
"    msg(\"old\", \"new\", \"`FLOWS`, then `COMMIT`\"),\n"
"    act(\"new\", \"Adopt the mappings, accept TCP\"),\n"
"    msg(\"new\", \"old\", \"`DONE`\", accent: true),\n"
